N:This is the first half of each line of the Moincoin Jig(Not necessarily
N:implying that it was the Mooncoin Jig first,of course) Or just what a
N:working musician uses to remind  him/her of how the tune goes.(On this
N:basis I have added a complete set of repeat marks to stop it playing
N:right through..CGP) Key
N:signature given as 3 sharps, but two of them are F's.  I think the
N:squiggle over the F in the 3rd bar  is the shake sign.  I'm not sure.
N:"1"  Bar line added..CGr....CGP
H:See Paul's Notes..
